Package: synthcontrol
Type: Package
Title: Synthetic Control Method for jamovi
Version: 1.0.0
Author: Mingchao Sun
Maintainer: Mingchao Sun <mingchao.sun@hotmail.com>
Description: Synthetic control method (Abadie, Diamond and Hainmueller, 2010) for
    comparative case studies with panel data, implemented as a jamovi module.
    Donor weights are estimated by constrained quadratic programming, with
    predictor weights chosen by nested optimisation. Inference uses in-space
    placebo tests with one-sided (RMSPE ratio) or two-sided (absolute average
    gap) permutation p-values. Robustness checks cover leave-one-out, treatment
    timing, pre-period length and in-time placebo.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    jmvcore (>= 2.3.4),
    ggplot2,
    R6,
    quadprog
